 if an event is full. When a spot becomes available\, we will move you to t
 he going-list.\n\nGoing List:\nOnly Members on the going-list can particip
 ate on the day of the event.\n\nGroup Instagram -\n@tjex.ca\n\nFeel free t
 o follow us!
